        "MOFFEIN_ROCKET_BODY_UTILITY_ALT_NAME": "轰炸行动<color=#8888>(舞铲阶级)</color>",
        "MOFFEIN_ROCKET_BODY_UTILITY_ALT_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>重型</style>。<style=cIsDamage>眩晕</style>。用爆破铲攻击敌人，造成<style=cIsDamage>1200%伤害</style>。在<style=cIsUtility>爆炸跳跃期间</style>造成<style=cIsDamage>暴击</style>。",
        "MOFFEIN_ROCKET_BODY_UTILITY_ALT_SCEPTER_NAME": "轰炸行动<color=#8888>(大满贯)</color>",
        "MOFFEIN_ROCKET_BODY_UTILITY_ALT_SCEPTER_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>重型</style>。<style=cIsDamage>眩晕</style>。用爆破铲攻击敌人，造成<style=cIsDamage>1800%伤害</style>。在<style=cIsUtility>爆炸跳跃期间</style>造成<style=cIsDamage>暴击</style>。",
